msgid "Package ownership and seven-layer map"
msgstr "软件包职责归属与七层架构映射"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:80
msgid "The `relic\\` package comprises `16` top-level subpackages containing `594` subpackage `.py` files (`595` Python files including `relic\\__init__.py`) and `316,129` lines of Python. Static import analysis across those `16` subpackages records `73` directed cross-package edge pairs, `973` cross-package import statements, and `11` mutual package pairs governed by the layered dependency rules."
msgstr "`relic\\` 软件包由 `16` 个顶层子包组成，包含 `594` 个子包 `.py` 文件（含 `relic\\__init__.py` 共 `595` 个 Python 文件）与 `316,129` 行 Python 代码。对这 `16` 个子包的静态导入分析共记录 `73` 对有向跨包依赖边、`973` 条跨包导入语句，以及受分层依赖规则治理的 `11` 对双向包依赖。"

