#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:146
msgid "Bridge Classes connect the scientific interface to the system lifecycle. They do not waive conservation, gradient, metadata, or unit obligations defined by the abstraction."
msgstr "Bridge Class 将科学接口接入系统 lifecycle，但不会免除抽象层定义的守恒、梯度、metadata 或单位义务。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:150
msgid "Functor lifecycle and metadata"
msgstr "Functor lifecycle 与 metadata"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:152
msgid "`FunctorBase` owns parameter namespace resolution, metadata, device migration, forward execution hooks, diagnostics, and local conservation integration. Concrete Functors implement `forward(state, time, dt, **kwargs)` and return declared updates. The simulator calls the Functor object; it does not bypass the `__call__()` lifecycle."
msgstr "`FunctorBase` 负责参数 namespace 解析、metadata、设备迁移、forward 执行 hook、diagnostic 和局部守恒集成。具体 Functor 实现 `forward(state, time, dt, **kwargs)` 并返回已声明的更新。simulator 调用 Functor 对象，不会绕过 `__call__()` lifecycle。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:158
msgid "`FunctorMetadata` identifies inputs, outputs, dependencies, execution stage, spatial scale, variable kind, references, equations, units, and conserved quantities. Empty input and output declarations reduce auditability. Competing writers for the same non-diagnostic output are detected during registration and may be rejected in strict dependency mode."
msgstr "`FunctorMetadata` 标识输入、输出、依赖、execution stage、spatial scale、variable kind、参考文献、方程、单位和守恒量。空的输入与输出声明会降低可审计性。注册时会检测同一非 diagnostic 输出的竞争 writer，并可在 strict dependency mode 下拒绝注册。"

