#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:178
msgid "`ContractRegistry` provides aliases, owners, permitted writers, increment semantics, and conservation-domain membership when contracts are enabled. `StateManager.apply_updates(...)` is the governed commit path. It resolves aliases, authorizes writes, applies update semantics, maintains element ledgers, records provenance, and rolls back failed transactional commits."
msgstr "启用契约时，`ContractRegistry` 提供 alias、owner、获准 writer、增量语义和守恒域成员关系。`StateManager.apply_updates(...)` 是受控提交路径，负责解析 alias、授权写入、应用更新语义、维护元素 ledger、记录 provenance，并回滚失败的事务性提交。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:184
msgid "Parameters, constants, units, and time"
msgstr "参数、常量、单位与时间"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:186
msgid "Scientific Functors obtain runtime values only through `self.get_parameter_value(...)`. Non-Functor infrastructure uses `get_global_manager().get(...)`. Parameter values, units, dtype, bounds, references, provenance, tags, and gradient settings belong in the parameter YAML database. Under default runtime settings, `UnifiedParameterManager` loads `4,643` active parameters (`810` with `requires_grad=True`), backed by `138` YAML files (`134` in the base `relic` tier with `4,642` leaf entries and `4` in the `calibrated` tier with `109` leaf entries, totaling `4,751` YAML leaf entries)."
msgstr "科学 Functor 仅通过 `self.get_parameter_value(...)` 获取运行时参数值。非 Functor 基础设施使用 `get_global_manager().get(...)`。参数值、单位、dtype、上下界、参考文献、溯源信息、标签与梯度设置均归入参数 YAML 数据库。在默认运行时设置下，`UnifiedParameterManager` 加载 `4,643` 个有效参数（其中 `810` 个设置 `requires_grad=True`），由 `138` 个 YAML 文件支撑（基础 `relic` 层含 `134` 个文件、`4,642` 个叶条目，`calibrated` 层含 `4` 个文件、`109` 个叶条目，合计 `4,751` 个 YAML 叶条目）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:196
msgid "Physical constants are owned only by `relic\\parameters\\database\\relic\\physical\\constants.yaml` and are accessed through `get_physical_constant(...)`. Time conversion values are resolved through `UnifiedParameterManager`; derived fallbacks may use already resolved values. Scientific modules must not define duplicate constants or unit registries."
msgstr "物理常数仅由 `relic\\parameters\\database\\relic\\physical\\constants.yaml` 管理，并通过 `get_physical_constant(...)` 访问。时间换算值通过 `UnifiedParameterManager` 解析；derived fallback 可以使用已解析的值。科学模块不得定义重复的常数或 unit registry。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:216
msgid "Simulator, execution rates, and device policy"
msgstr "Simulator、执行频率与 device policy"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:218
msgid "`RELICSimulator` owns registration, dependency ordering, fast/medium/slow execution groups, stepping, output storage, checkpoint integration, provenance, and diagnostics."
msgstr "`RELICSimulator` 负责注册、依赖排序、fast/medium/slow execution group、时间推进、输出存储、checkpoint 集成、provenance 和 diagnostic。"

