#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:228
msgid "A Functor's group is fixed at registration by one priority chain: the `execution_group` argument, then the Functor's own `execution_group` attribute, then its characteristic time compared with two classification thresholds from the parameter database (`computation.scheduling.fast_group_max_characteristic_days` and `computation.scheduling.medium_group_max_characteristic_days`; current configuration example: 1 day and 10 days), then its temporal scale, then the `process_groups` configuration entry, and finally `fast` when nothing is declared. Every declared value is checked, also when a higher rule decides: an invalid group name, a characteristic time that is not a finite non-negative number of days, a temporal scale name that names no scale (rejected already when the Functor's metadata is built), or a `process_groups` entry that disagrees with the attribute, characteristic time, or temporal scale raises `ValueError` before anything is registered. To override a `process_groups` entry, pass the group as the argument. The thresholds classify processes; they are not execution intervals. The medium interval is `medium_interval_seconds`; the slow interval is `slow_interval_seconds` or, when that key is unset, the month of the configured calendar. A medium or slow group also runs when one of its Functors requests a bootstrap execution or when a registered event trigger fires; a bootstrap request is used up whenever the group runs. A group runs at most once per step: a step that crosses several boundaries runs it once over the whole elapsed interval."
msgstr "Functor 的执行组在注册时按唯一优先链确定：先看 `execution_group` 参数，再看 Functor 自身的 `execution_group` 属性，再比较其特征时间与参数数据库中的两个分类阈值（`computation.scheduling.fast_group_max_characteristic_days` 和 `computation.scheduling.medium_group_max_characteristic_days`；当前配置示例为 1 天和 10 天），之后看时间尺度、`process_groups` 配置项，最后在完全未声明时采用 `fast`。即使较高优先规则已作出决定，也要检查所有声明：组名无效、特征时间不是有限且非负的天数、时间尺度名无对应尺度（构建 Functor 元数据时就会拒绝），或 `process_groups` 与属性、特征时间或时间尺度不一致，都会在注册任何内容之前抛出 `ValueError`。要覆盖 `process_groups` 配置项，应通过参数传入执行组。阈值只用于过程分类，不是执行间隔。中速间隔为 `medium_interval_seconds`；慢速间隔为 `slow_interval_seconds`，未设置该键时按配置历法的月份执行。某个 Functor 请求引导执行或已注册事件触发器触发时，中速或慢速组也会执行；该组一旦执行，引导请求即被消耗。每组每步最多执行一次：若一步跨过多个边界，则只针对全部已过去区间执行一次。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:252
msgid "Every call receives the start of the interval it covers as its `time` argument, plus any sub-step offset. The fast group starts at the step start; in Strang mode the second half-steps start half a step later; a medium or slow group starts at its last execution time. For example, a medium group last run at 0 s is called in the step from 1 s to 2 s with `time = 0` and `dt = 2`. How a process samples time-dependent forcing inside that interval is still a property of the process."
msgstr "每次调用都将覆盖区间的起始时间，加上子步偏移，作为 `time` 参数。快速组从步骤起点开始；Strang 模式的后半步从半步之后开始；中速或慢速组从上次执行时刻开始。例如，上次在 0 s 执行的中速组，在 1 s 到 2 s 的步骤中接收 `time = 0` 和 `dt = 2`。过程如何在该区间内采样随时间变化的强迫，仍由过程自身决定。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:260
msgid "The adaptive option uses a scaled RMS metric over the state changes that the fast group committed. It is a control heuristic, not a Richardson or local-truncation-error estimate. A rejected first attempt is rolled back and retried at most once, over a shorter interval, and only when it is longer than the minimum step; an attempt at or below the minimum step is accepted with a warning. Only fast-group updates enter the metric. The retry result is accepted without a second check, so an accepted step can exceed the tolerance."
msgstr "自适应选项对快速组已提交的状态变化计算缩放 RMS 指标。它是控制启发式方法，不是 Richardson 外推或局部截断误差估计。首次尝试被拒绝时会回滚，且仅在其步长大于最小步长时，才在更短区间上最多重试一次；步长等于或小于最小步长的尝试会被接受并记录警告。只有快速组更新进入指标。重试结果不经第二次检查就接受，因此已接受步骤仍可能超出容差。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:269
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`RELICSimulator(None)` normalizes `None` to the empty configuration `{}`, under which `enable_auto_scale` defaults to `False`. Device selection is centralized in `relic\\core\\device_policy.py`. Pre-registration construction places every `FunctorBase` instance on a CPU placeholder until simulator registration migrates it to its resolved runtime device. `resolve_device(...)` evaluates seven precedence tiers:"
msgstr "`RELICSimulator(None)` 会将 `None` 规范化为空配置 `{}`，在此配置下 `enable_auto_scale` 默认设为 `False`。设备选择集中由 `relic\\core\\device_policy.py` 管理。注册前的构造阶段会将每个 `FunctorBase` 实例置于 CPU 占位设备上，直至模拟器注册阶段将其迁移至解析后的运行时设备。`resolve_device(...)` 按顺序评估七个优先级层："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:276
msgid "`explicit_device` argument (unless `\"auto\"` or `\"default\"`);"
msgstr "`explicit_device` 参数（值为 `\"auto\"` 或 `\"default\"` 时除外）；"

