msgid "configuration per-functor or per-module overrides (`device_overrides` and `module_device_overrides` at root, `simulator`, or `runtime`);"
msgstr "配置中的单 Functor 或单模块覆盖项（位于根级、`simulator` 或 `runtime` 节的 `device_overrides` 与 `module_device_overrides`）；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:279
msgid "runtime overrides from `set_device_overrides(...)` and environment overrides from `RELIC_DEVICE_OVERRIDES_JSON`;"
msgstr "来自 `set_device_overrides(...)` 的运行时覆盖项与来自 `RELIC_DEVICE_OVERRIDES_JSON` 的环境变量覆盖项；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:281
msgid "configuration global `device` (at root, `simulator`, or `runtime`);"
msgstr "配置中的全局 `device`（位于根级、`simulator` 或 `runtime` 节）；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:282
msgid "process-wide default device from `set_default_device(...)`;"
msgstr "来自 `set_default_device(...)` 的进程级默认设备；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:283
msgid "`RELIC_DEFAULT_DEVICE` environment variable; and"
msgstr "`RELIC_DEFAULT_DEVICE` 环境变量；以及"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:284
msgid "distributed CUDA-first selection with automatic fallback to CPU when `distributed=True`, or the caller's `default` (`\"cpu\"` by default)."
msgstr "`distributed=True` 时的分布式 CUDA 优先选择（不可用时回退至 CPU），或调用方传入的 `default`（默认为 `\"cpu\"`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:287
msgid "Invalid override mappings raise `TypeError` and unparseable device entries raise `RuntimeError`. Distributed and `auto` execution prefer CUDA and fall back automatically to CPU when CUDA is unavailable (unless `require_gpu=True` requires failure), whereas an explicit `enable_distributed: true` configuration that cannot be satisfied raises `RuntimeError`. Scientific modules must not perform scattered CUDA availability checks outside `relic\\core\\device_policy.py`."
msgstr "无效的覆盖映射会抛出 `TypeError`，无法解析的设备条目会抛出 `RuntimeError`。分布式与 `auto` 执行模式优先选择 CUDA，并在 CUDA 不可用时回退至 CPU（除非 `require_gpu=True` 要求直接报错）；若显式设置的 `enable_distributed: true` 配置无法满足，则抛出 `RuntimeError`。科学模块不得在 `relic\\core\\device_policy.py` 之外零散检查 CUDA 可用性。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:294
msgid "Structural scientific layer"
msgstr "结构化科学层"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:296
msgid "RELIC reuses DEC and IPHS structures through `relic\\computation\\operators\\dec\\` and `relic\\computation\\operators\\iphs.py`. Structural declarations can establish typed cochain relationships, selected topological identities, operator symmetry or skew-symmetry, and declared port relationships."
msgstr "RELIC 通过 `relic\\computation\\operators\\dec\\` 和 `relic\\computation\\operators\\iphs.py` 复用 DEC 与 IPHS 结构。结构声明可以建立 typed cochain 关系、选定的拓扑恒等式、operator 对称性或反对称性，以及已声明的 port 关系。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:302
msgid "They do not by themselves prove an executable reaction law, a closed material ledger, an energy or entropy closure, or a strict GENERIC implementation. Reaction processes that claim structured execution must evaluate the declared stoichiometric operator and rate law in the runtime path. Closed ledgers need a runtime conservation matrix; open ledgers need an explicit route."
msgstr "这些结构本身不能证明存在可执行的反应定律、闭合的物质 ledger、能量或熵闭合，也不能证明实现了 strict GENERIC。声称采用结构化执行的反应过程，必须在 runtime path 中计算已声明的 stoichiometric operator 和 rate law。闭合 ledger 需要运行时 conservation matrix；开放 ledger 需要显式 route。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:308
msgid "`IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` is the only owner of the IPHS standardization level. Levels below strict IPHS must not be described as strict merely because they expose compatible fields or diagnostics."
msgstr "`IPHSEquivalenceCertificate` 是 IPHS standardization level 的唯一 owner。低于 strict IPHS 的 level 不能仅因暴露了兼容字段或 diagnostic 就被描述为 strict。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:312
msgid "End-to-end assembly and execution"
msgstr "端到端装配与执行"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:314
msgid "RELIC separates model declaration, structural compilation, numerical execution, and state commitment. The separation is functional: passing one stage does not imply that a later stage has passed."
msgstr "RELIC 将模型声明、结构编译、数值执行和状态提交分开。该分离具有实际执行含义：某一阶段通过，并不表示其后的阶段也已通过。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:318
msgid "`GraphExecutor` builds the planned Functors and registers them into one `RELICSimulator` per prepared run. The simulator's `step(...)` is the only scientific state advance; `GraphExecutor` never commits state itself. Three graphs are kept apart: the declared graph (GraphIR links and Functor dependencies), the resolved execution order used by the simulator, and the physical exchange graph of stocks and fluxes. An execution edge orders computations; it does not establish a conserved transfer."
msgstr "`GraphExecutor` 构建计划中的 Functor，并在每次已准备的运行中将它们注册到一个 `RELICSimulator` 中。模拟器的 `step(...)` 是唯一的科学状态推进；`GraphExecutor` 自身从不进行状态提交。三种图相互分离：声明图（GraphIR 链接与 Functor 依赖）、模拟器使用的解析执行顺序，以及由储量和通量构成的物理交换图。执行边只决定计算的先后顺序，并不建立守恒的转移。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:326
msgid "The graph path is"
msgstr "图装配路径为"

