msgid "`compile_graph(...)` may proceed only under its selected strictness policy; a blocking validation issue is not converted into an executable scientific result. The runtime path for one Functor call can be written as"
msgstr "`compile_graph(...)` 只能在所选严格性策略下继续；阻断性验证问题不会被转换为可执行的科学结果。单次 Functor 调用的运行时路径可写为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:340
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{F}_i:\n"
"(x,s_g,h_g,\\theta_i)\n"
"\\longmapsto U_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"U_i=\\{\\mathrm{UpdateItem}_{i,k}\\}_k,\n"
