"\n"
"\\mathcal{F}_i:\n"
"(x,s_g,h_g,\\theta_i)\n"
"\\longmapsto U_i,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"U_i=\\{\\mathrm{UpdateItem}_{i,k}\\}_k,\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:348
msgid "followed by one governed commit per group call $g$ (the fast group, or each Strang sub-execution, then the medium and slow groups when due), all inside one step transaction"
msgstr "随后，每个组调用 $g$（fast 组或每个 Strang 子执行，然后是到期的 medium 与 slow 组）各进行一次受治理的状态提交，全部位于同一个步事务之内"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:352
msgid ""
"\n"
"x^{(g)}\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{StateManager}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"x^{(g-1)},\n"
"\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathcal{A}_g}U_i;\n"
"h_g,\\Gamma\n"
"\\right),\n"
"\\qquad x^{(0)}=x^n,\\quad x^{n+1}=x^{(G)},\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"x^{(g)}\n"
"=\n"
"\\mathcal{C}_{\\mathrm{StateManager}}\n"
"\\left(\n"
"x^{(g-1)},\n"
"\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathcal{A}_g}U_i;\n"
"h_g,\\Gamma\n"
"\\right),\n"
"\\qquad x^{(0)}=x^n,\\quad x^{n+1}=x^{(G)},\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:364
msgid "where $\\theta_i$ is resolved by `UnifiedParameterManager`, $x$ is the committed or provisional state that Functor $i$ reads, $s_g$ is the start of the interval covered by group call $g$, $\\mathcal{A}_g$ is the dependency- and rate-selected active Functor set of group call $g$, $G$ is the number of group calls in the step, and $\\Gamma$ contains variable contracts, update modes, writer permissions, units, and conservation-domain membership. The interval $h_g$ is the step length for the fast group (the half or full step of a Strang sub-execution) and $t_{\\mathrm{future}}-t_{\\mathrm{last}}$ for a medium or slow group. The start $s_g$ is the step start $t_n$ for the fast group, for the first Strang half-steps, and for the middle full step; $t_n+h/2$ for the second Strang half-steps; and $t_{\\mathrm{last}}$ for a medium or slow group. A Functor with $m$ sub-steps is called $m$ times with $h_g/m$ at the times $s_g+k\\,h_g/m$, $k=0,\\ldots,m-1$. The step is accepted or rolled back as a whole: a failure later in the step restores every group commit of that step. The commit operator is not an unconditional sum: `REPLACE`, `ACCUMULATE`, flux integration, aliases, projections, and rejection or rollback retain their declared semantics."
msgstr "其中 $\\theta_i$ 由 `UnifiedParameterManager` 解析，$x$ 是 Functor $i$ 读取的已提交或临时状态，$s_g$ 是组调用 $g$ 所覆盖区间的起始时间，$\\mathcal{A}_g$ 是组调用 $g$ 根据依赖和执行速率选择的活跃 Functor 集合，$G$ 为该步骤中的组调用次数，$\\Gamma$ 包含变量契约、更新模式、写入权限、单位和守恒域归属。快速组的区间 $h_g$ 为步长（Strang 子执行的半步或整步），中速或慢速组则采用 $t_{\\mathrm{future}}-t_{\\mathrm{last}}$。起点 $s_g$ 对快速组、Strang 的前半步和中间整步取步骤起点 $t_n$；后半步取 $t_n+h/2$；中速或慢速组取 $t_{\\mathrm{last}}$。具有 $m$ 个子步的 Functor 会在时刻 $s_g+k\\,h_g/m$、$k=0,\\ldots,m-1$ 被调用 $m$ 次，每次步长为 $h_g/m$。整个步骤统一接受或回滚：步骤后续阶段失败时，会恢复该步骤的所有组提交。提交算子不是无条件求和：`REPLACE`、`ACCUMULATE`、通量积分、别名、投影以及拒绝或回滚都保留各自声明的语义。"

