#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:395
msgid "Within one group call, the simulator builds a provisional state so that a later Functor of the same call, such as a declared downstream dependency, can consume an upstream result. That provisional state is not an independent state owner; the authoritative state changes only through the `StateManager.apply_updates(...)` call at the end of that group call. A failure later in the same step restores all group commits of that step. In `strang` mode every sub-execution is its own group call, so a downstream Functor reads the upstream result from the state committed by the upstream's earlier sub-execution, not from a shared provisional state. A Functor that declares `subprocess_outputs` receives the upstream's returned outputs from the dependency-output map that all `2n - 1` sub-executions of the fast-group composition share; these are the outputs of the upstream's most recent earlier sub-execution, its first half-step over `[t, t + h/2]`. The same composition merges each Functor's diagnostics over its sub-executions by the rule that merges the returned outputs, and StateManager stores the merged values, so the stored diagnostics of a step equal the returned ones."
msgstr "一次组调用内，模拟器构建临时状态，使同次调用中较晚执行的 Functor（例如已声明的下游依赖）能够使用上游结果。该临时状态不是独立的状态所有者；权威状态只通过该组调用结束时的 `StateManager.apply_updates(...)` 改变。同一步骤后续阶段失败时，会恢复该步骤的全部组提交。在 `strang` 模式下，每次子执行都是独立的组调用，因此下游 Functor 从上游先前子执行已提交的状态读取结果，而不是从共享临时状态读取。声明 `subprocess_outputs` 的 Functor 从依赖输出映射接收上游返回值；快速组组合的全部 `2n - 1` 次子执行共享该映射。读到的是上游最近一次先行子执行的输出，即 `[t, t + h/2]` 上的首个半步结果。同一组合也按返回输出的合并规则，合并每个 Functor 各次子执行的诊断量；StateManager 存储合并值，因此步骤存储的诊断量与返回值一致。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:412
msgid "Connection and conservation rules"
msgstr "连接与守恒规则"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:414
msgid "An execution dependency is a declared ordering and data contract. If an edge $i\\rightarrow j$ is active, $j$ may consume only the declared output of $i$ with compatible identity, units, shape, support, and temporal semantics. The following rules apply:"
msgstr "执行依赖是一项已声明的顺序与数据契约。当边 $i\\rightarrow j$ 生效时，$j$ 只能读取 $i$ 已声明且在 identity、单位、shape、support 和时间语义上兼容的输出。具体规则如下："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:419
msgid "A concrete Functor does not call another concrete Functor directly. Composition is expressed through metadata, GraphIR links, ports, adapters, and the simulator dependency graph."
msgstr "具体 Functor 不直接调用另一个具体 Functor。组合关系通过 metadata、GraphIR link、port、adapter 和 simulator dependency graph 表达。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:422
msgid "Parameters flow from `UnifiedParameterManager` into Functors; GraphIR and `StateManager` do not become secondary parameter stores."
msgstr "参数从 `UnifiedParameterManager` 流入 Functor；GraphIR 和 `StateManager` 不成为第二参数存储。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:424
msgid "Diagnostics are reported outputs. They do not acquire prognostic ownership unless a separate variable contract explicitly authorizes that role."
msgstr "Diagnostic 是报告输出。除非独立变量契约明确授权，否则 diagnostic 不获得预报状态所有权。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:426
msgid "Unit, support, temporal, and spatial changes require a declared executable adapter. A metadata relabel is not a conversion."
msgstr "单位、support、时间或空间尺度变换需要已声明的可执行 adapter。只修改 metadata 标签不构成转换。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:428
msgid "A Functor-level conservation check proves only its declared local ledger or constitutive relation. System conservation also requires compatible ports, common support and units, and the relevant storage change."
msgstr "Functor 级守恒检查仅证明其已声明的局部账本或本构关系。系统级守恒还要求端口兼容、支撑域与单位一致，并计入相应的储量变化。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:432
msgid "For a declared storage $S$, a step ledger has the form"
msgstr "对于已声明储量 $S$，单步账本形式为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:434
msgid ""
"\n"
"R_S\n"
"=\n"
"\\left(S^{n+1}-S^n\\right)\n"
"-\n"
"\\Delta t\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\sum F_{\\mathrm{in}}\n"
"-\n"
"\\sum F_{\\mathrm{out}}\n"
"\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R_S\n"
"=\n"
"\\left(S^{n+1}-S^n\\right)\n"
"-\n"
"\\Delta t\n"
"\\left(\n"
"\\sum F_{\\mathrm{in}}\n"
"-\n"
"\\sum F_{\\mathrm{out}}\n"
"\\right).\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/architecture.md:447
msgid "The residual is meaningful only after every term is mapped to the same quantity, unit, spatial support, and time interval. A zero structural residual, a successful process exit, or `C N = 0` for one closed reaction ledger does not by itself prove whole-system mass, energy, entropy, or strict GENERIC closure. The detailed equations and applicability conditions are maintained in the [theory guide](theory/index.rst); class-specific ports and runtime equations are maintained in the [scientific class reference](science/index.rst)."
msgstr "只有当每一项都映射到相同物理量、单位、空间 support 和时间区间后，该 residual 才有意义。结构 residual 为零、进程成功退出，或某个闭合反应账本满足 `C N = 0`，均不能单独证明全系统质量、能量、熵或 strict GENERIC 闭合。详细方程和适用条件由[理论指南](theory/index.rst)维护；类级 port 与运行方程由[科学类参考](science/index.rst)维护。"

